--- !u!114 &6511674152967130344
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8454224860224320350}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 735559d9c8b117146a70d7fea44587a7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  message: {fileID: 1219961822299568662}
  sellerAnimator: {fileID: 3616837101104600567}
  timePerCharacter: 0.02
  enterShopMessages:
  - Welcome, traveler! Step inside... my prices are as good as my wares.
  - "Ah, a new face! Take a look around; I\u2019m sure I have something that\u2019ll
    save your life today."
  - Come in and shake off the dust of the road. What exactly are you looking for?
  - "Just in time! I\u2019ve just restocked. Don't be shy, browse to your heart's
    content."
  - "Hello, hello! I hope your coin purse is heavy, because I\u2019ve got wonders
    today."
  notEnoughMoneyMessages:
  - Hahaha! With that? In your dreams.
  - Gold or air? Because your bag is empty.
  - Heh... come back when you're rich, 'Wizzard'.
  - Nice pockets... pity they're empty.
  - Seriously? Don't waste my time.
  purchasedItemMessages:
  - Excellent choice! That item has been waiting for someone like you.
  - "Treat it well; it\u2019s the best quality you\u2019ll find in these parts."
  - Sold! A flawless transaction. Anything else for your collection?
  - "I knew you\u2019d eye that one. You\u2019ve got good taste, I can\u2019t deny
    it."
  - "Done! Here you go. I guarantee it\u2019ll be of great use to you."
  purchasedHealMessages:
  - Wise decision! Better safe than ending up in a grave, right?
  - Drink it down in one go. It tastes awful, but it'll make you feel brand new!
  - "Here\u2019s your life insurance. Try not to use it too soon."
  - A top-shelf potion... distilled with care for reckless adventurers.
  - Cheers! Literally. This will help you take a few more hits.
  closeShopMessages:
  - Bye!!
  - Come back!!
  - 'Take care! '
  inventoryFullMessages:
  - You're bursting! Drop something first.
  - No room, no deal. Empty your pack.
  - Where will you put that? You're full!
  - Make room or leave. Your choice.
  - Your bag can't take any more, traveler.
  outOfStockMessages:
  - You already took it! No more left.
  - Sold out. Find something else.
  - Sorry, that was the only one.
  - You were fast! They're all gone.
  - Not a trace left. Sold!
